            <description><![CDATA[<p>BendMac now opens its settings when you launch it from Spotlight or Raycast, even if it's already running in the menu bar. Closed and minimized windows come back too.</p>
<ul>
<li>A stronger fold that keeps the bottom edge at the hinge and includes the menu bar.</li>
<li>A translucent sidebar with Liquid Glass selection on macOS 26 and newer.</li>
<li>A MacBook preview with playback controls and a live lid-angle option.</li>
<li>Set the clear angle from your current lid position. Resetting appearance keeps your calibration.</li>
<li>Retina desktop capture, Open at login, and a retry button for capture connections.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
